      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Verdunville%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Mud Fork is an east-flowing tributary of Island Creek and part of the Guyandotte River watershed.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
