      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Verdunville%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mud Fork Road runs through Verdunville and the neighboring community of Shegon.",
